flowchart TB
    A([Start]) --> B{User signed in?}
    B -- No --> C[Sign up or log in]
    C --> D[Upload resume]
    B -- Yes --> E{Resume and profile ready?}
    E -- No --> D
    E -- Yes --> F[Choose job level, role, location, work type, and salary needs]
    D --> G[Foundry drafts resume summary]
    G --> H[User reviews and edits summary]
    H --> I[Save profile]
    I --> F
    F --> J[Search chosen job sources]
    J --> K[Clean listings and remove duplicates]
    K --> L[Compare jobs with resume and profile using Foundry]
    L --> M{Match score 75% or higher?}
    M -- Yes --> N[Mark High Priority]
    M -- No --> O[Add to Related]
    N --> P{Score 85% or higher?}
    P -- Yes --> Q{Site allows it and all answers are known?}
    Q -- Yes --> R[Submit application automatically]
    R --> S[Save result and notify user]
    Q -- No --> T[Send to manual review and explain why]
    P -- No --> U[Show in dashboard for user review]
    O --> U
    T --> U
    S --> V[Show match reasons and application status]
    U --> V
    V --> W{User wants to apply manually?}
    W -- Yes --> X[Research company and prepare documents]
    X --> Y[Help fill form where allowed]
    Y --> Z[User reviews and submits]
    Z --> AA[Save application status]
    W -- No --> AB[Keep in dashboard or dismiss]
    V --> AC[Send optional Telegram alert for High Priority jobs]
